data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-edge-badpath","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_0057275d6001utIw1ndHyaXVPV","role":"user","content":"用 render_a2ui 渲染 surfaceId=e-badpath：Column 根，含一个 Text（id=t1，text 绑定 {\"path\":\"nonexistent.field\"}）和一个 Text（id=t2，写\"绑定异常存活\"）。data 模型只放 {\"foo\":1}。严格照做。"},{"id":"msg_0057275e4001f1SMhj25fUMPrp-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render an A2UI with a Column root, containing a Text with id=t1 binding to {\"path\":\"nonexistent.field\"} and a Text with id=t2 with text \"绑定异常存活\". Data model only has {\"foo\":1}.\n\nLet me follow the contract:\n- Column {children:[id]}\n- Text {text, variant?} - text can be a binding {path}\n- data: {\"foo\":1}\n\nSo the components array:\n- root: Column, children: [\"t1\",\"t2\"]\n- t1: Text, text: {\"path\":\"nonexistent.field\"}\n- t2: Text, text: \"绑定异常存活\"\n\ndata: {\"foo\":1}\n\nLet me render this."},{"id":"msg_0057275e4001f1SMhj25fUMPrp","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_utJ7IoZ4I4hWKGFdEhii9019","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"e-badpath\",\"data\":{\"foo\":1},\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"t1\",\"t2\"]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"t1\",\"text\":{\"path\":\"nonexistent.field\"}},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"t2\",\"text\":\"绑定异常存活\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_utJ7IoZ4I4hWKGFdEhii9019","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_utJ7IoZ4I4hWKGFdEhii9019","content":"UI surface \"e-badpath\" rendered (3 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_00572812e001i7111SwGHjoRem","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染 e-badpath：根 Column 下 t1 绑定不存在的 `nonexistent.field`，t2 显示\"绑定异常存活\"。"}]}

